llvm: AArch64 ILP32 (llvm-ilp32 0001-0012)

GNU ILP32 code generation fixes (pointer zero extension at ABI boundaries, FastISel, wrapping
address offsets, ELF32 .note.gnu.property, widening multiplies), Cortex-A35 tuning and the
musl_ilp32 environment, from https://github.com/ilp32-a64/llvm-ilp32 (LLVM 22.1.8) applied to
the bundled LLVM 22.1.2. Test files are left out (not in the rustc source tarball).

